{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"384260","name":"Aqua Mirage Club & Aqua Parc - All Inclusive","description":"This modern hotel boasts a package of a traditional-style courtyards, wonderfully landscaped gardens and a waterpark-crowned pool scene. The rooms are designed with a contemporary flair, offering all the modern amenities, including flat-screen TVs. Their only downside is that due to the amount of attractions the venue offers, guests won't spend enough time in them. They will be spoiled with choice at the exciting first-rate waterpark that is loaded with slides including a Spacebowl, Blackhole and a section just for the youngest guests chock-full of slides and fountains. Plus there are 2 extra pools and a poolside bar to provide endless stream of chilled drinks. The lights of the Red City, called so due to the blush-coloured walls that surround it, are just a 20-minute shuttle bus ride away and it is still exciting as ever and still offers a magical mix of modern and traditional.","address":"Km 5, Tahanaout Road 40065 - Marrakech - Morocco","city":"Marrakech","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40065","lat":31.534769224328315,"lng":-7.99245776166408,"stars":4,"chain":"MAGIC","giataCode":"418125","phone":"+00212525078000","email":"resa.aquamirage@magichotels.ma","website":"www.magichotels.ma","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_015.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_023.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_019.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_024.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_017.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/38/384260/384260a_hb_a_014.jpg","categ